        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 5.6,
            "end": 12.9,
            "text": "Game, set and match, Zverev. Three sets to one: 6-3, 7-6, 5-7, 6-2.\n比赛结束，兹维列夫3比1获胜。"
          },
          {
            "at": 13.0,
            "end": 16.7,
            "text": "Zverev doesn't know he's won. He doesn't even know he's won.\n兹维列夫还不知道自己赢了。"
          },
          {
            "at": 18.4,
            "end": 19.1,
            "text": "There you go.\n这下知道了。"
          },
          {
            "at": 26.0,
            "end": 31.5,
            "text": "He really didn't know. He was so focused in on just holding serve.\n他真的不知道，一心只想保发。"
          },
          {
            "at": 31.5,
            "end": 38.0,
            "text": "He didn't know he was at the finish line, and he finishes off Ben Shelton in four sets\n没意识到已到终点，四盘击败谢尔顿，"
          },
          {
            "at": 38.0,
            "end": 44.8,
            "text": "and wins his second major of the year, his first US Open.\n拿下年度第二座大满贯、首个美网。"
          }
        ],
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
